# 2023.sk: Master Ksynth Drum Patch Loading & 16-Step Groove
# -------------------------------------------------------------
M 120

# Load bundled Ksynth drum & synth patches into wave slots:
# [sk/drums-kick.ks]   /ks k>d d>r /r 100
# [sk/drums-snare.ks]  /ks k>d d>r /r 101
# [sk/drums-chh.ks]    /ks k>d d>r /r 102
# [sk/gm-lead-moog.ks] /ks k>d d>r /r 103

# Voice Setup (Natural root pitch f440 for drums v0 auto-chokes kick tails):

v0 w82 f440 a0          # Kick
v1 w83 f440 a-2           # Snare
v2 w84 f440 a-7           # Closed Hat
# v3 w103 f220 a-2           # Moog Synth Lead
v3 w15 a-6 N-12    t .01 .4 0 0 G4 H4
v4 w15 a-6 N-24,10 t .01 .4 0 0
# 16-Step Pattern (Full 4/4 Bar @ 120 BPM)
y0
[v0l1 v3n48l1] x0
[v2l0.4] x1
[v2l0.4] x2
[v2l0.4 v3n51l0.6] x3
[v1l1 v3n48l1] x4
[v2l0.4] x5
[v2l0.4] x6
[v2l0.4 v3n55l0.6] x7
[v0l1 v3n48l1] x8
[v2l0.4] x9
[v0l0.8 v3n58l0.6] x10
[v2l0.4] x11
[v1l1 v3n60l1] x12
[v2l0.4] x13
[v2l0.4 v3n58l0.6] x14
[v1l0.8 z*3] x15          # Triplet Snare Ratchet Fill

# Start Pattern
Z1
